    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d97-a2">

                <pb facs="0389" n="341" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg341"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-07-23"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 23, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Moran, chargé d’affaires of the United States at London, presents his
                    compliments to —————— ——————, and has the honor to transmit herewith a letter
                    from the Department of State at Washington city. He begs to say that the volume
                    to which it refers will be sent through the channel named in the memorandum
                    below.</p>
                <p>Mr. Moran will be pleased to receive and forward to his government an
                    acknowledgment of the reception of the letter and volume in question.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
